## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- **Programming Language:** C++
- **Programming Paradigm:** Object-Oriented Programming
- **Compiler:** GCC / MinGW
- **Development Environment:** Visual Studio Code or any C++ IDE
- **Data Storage:** Text files
- **Version Control:** GitHub

