6. Make Payment
7. Display Customer Details
0. Exit
```

---

## 💳 Payment Methods

The system provides two simulated payment methods:

- UPI Payment
- Card Payment

**Note:** This project is an educational simulation. It does not process real financial transactions.

---

## 📁 File Handling

The project uses text files to store information.

- `products.txt` contains sample product information.
- `orders.txt` stores order details after successful order creation.

